From 46f63c8ffa551623bf1aa9d35d02120786c1d717 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 04:27:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fig. 2: ray traces (a)-(e) default to the 4 mm example,
 design cell selectable

In the 10 mm design cell the eight 25 um disks are sparse and the drawn
centre ray crosses one before it leaves (layout 1: once in 23 hits), so
panel (b) looked like the regular star orbit. The traces now default to the
earlier 4 mm cell with 16 x 50 um inclusions (50-180 crossings per drawn
ray); a menu switches to the design cell. The bars (f) stay the design cell.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NLfEqncaEw1RGMDLUGdFgb
